From what I have seen, DCE need not be present on the DNS machine.
In steps 3 & 4 above, all the IBM utilities do is take the DCE data files,
and append to the DNS data files.  If we can do that manually (i.e. append the
DCE generated data file to the DNS data file and update the name server), then
DCE is not needed on the DNS machine.    

